1
00:00:01,580 --> 00:00:03,380
Hey.

2
00:00:03,380 --> 00:00:06,010
Is something wrong?

3
00:00:06,010 --> 00:00:08,010
You can talk to me.

4
00:00:09,380 --> 00:00:11,180
This is...

5
00:00:11,180 --> 00:00:14,010
A charm my late mother
left behind for me.

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:18,560
I know how to cook,

7
00:00:18,560 --> 00:00:20,270
and I talk to myself a lot.

8
00:00:21,310 --> 00:00:23,650
Because I was always alone.

9
00:00:24,190 --> 00:00:27,550
I grew up in a single-parent home,
so my mother was rarely around.

10
00:00:29,490 --> 00:00:31,360
I knew she was working hard
for my sake.

11
00:00:31,360 --> 00:00:33,370
To keep the loneliness away,

12
00:00:33,950 --> 00:00:35,700
I'd find myself clutching this tightly.

13
00:00:39,370 --> 00:00:42,630
Then what does "destiny is not
decided by the stars" mean?

14
00:00:44,250 --> 00:00:47,380
I used to be too afraid
to speak my mind.

15
00:00:47,380 --> 00:00:50,220
But my mother always told me...

16
00:00:50,220 --> 00:00:52,260
To make my own decisions.

17
00:00:52,260 --> 00:00:54,800
To do what I wanted to do.

18
00:00:54,800 --> 00:00:58,480
That destiny is something
you carve out for yourself.

19
00:00:59,770 --> 00:01:01,560
She sounds like a wonderful mother.

20
00:01:01,560 --> 00:01:05,730
But I was so indecisive and cowardly.

21
00:01:07,780 --> 00:01:10,280
I kept her worrying about me...

22
00:01:10,280 --> 00:01:12,650
I never even got to repay her kindness.

23
00:01:13,780 --> 00:01:16,200
I was such a terrible son.

24
00:01:20,870 --> 00:01:22,920
Minato.

25
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,670
You don't have to hold it in around me.

26
00:01:28,300 --> 00:01:31,050
I'm sorry...

27
00:01:34,930 --> 00:01:37,560
(Talking about this with someone...)

28
00:01:37,560 --> 00:01:39,640
(This is the first time...)
